WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:10.639
To be a Getty is an extraordinary thing

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:16.219
My grandfather wasn't just the richest man in the world

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:22.280
He was the richest man in the history of the world

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:28.429
We look like you, but we're not like you

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:35.749
It's like we're from another planet

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:41.660
Where the force of gravity is so strong it bends the light

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:48.760
Offends people, too

00:00:52.769 --> 00:00:54.769
Mr Getty, your grandson

00:00:56.740 --> 00:01:00.540
Miss Getty, we have your son
Is this some kind of joke?

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:06.040
17 million dollars to release him
I don't have any money

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:09.500
Get it from your father-in-law. He has all the money in the world

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:19.920
Mr. Getty is unavailable. I'm sorry Miss Getty

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:23.640
I work for Mr. Getty
I'll help you find your son.

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:30.040
I'm not a real Getty. I just married one. I'm fighting an empire. You need to pay the ransom

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:34.340
They will do things to Paul that cannot be undone for any amount of money

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:40.240
I ask as a mother to set my boy free.

00:01:41.540 --> 00:01:44.740
We have to show we're willing to walk away.
I can't walk away

00:01:52.360 --> 00:01:57.700
Mr.Getty,  how much would you pay to release your grandson, if not 17 million dollars?

00:01:58.440 --> 00:01:59.280
Nothing.

